# Kernel config fragment for Cinnado B6 (T23ZN / OS02G10 / TM18NA LTE variant).
#
# USB host mode, for the TM18NA LTE module (T23 dwc2 controller). This is a
# deliberately minimal set (T23 is host, TM18NA is the USB device side, per
# its own datasheet). Not using thingino-kopt's BR2_PACKAGE_THINGINO_KOPT_
# DWC2_WIFI_ONLY here: on live hardware, it caused a hard hang immediately
# after "Starting kernel..." (before any console output at all), reproduced
# twice (with and without the separate I2C1 GPIO pull-up change, ruling that
# out as the cause). This exact minimal 4-line set was confirmed booting
# cleanly on real hardware first. The extra options DWC2_WIFI_ONLY also
# enables -- CONFIG_USB_ARCH_HAS_HCD, CONFIG_USB_ARCH_HAS_OHCI, CONFIG_USB_
# COMMON, CONFIG_USB_DWC2_VERBOSE_VERBOSE, CONFIG_USB_OTG -- are the
# suspects; not yet root-caused to a single symbol. Worth revisiting/
# reporting upstream once there's time to bisect further.
CONFIG_USB_SUPPORT=y
CONFIG_USB=y
CONFIG_USB_JZ_DWC2=y
CONFIG_USB_DWC2_HOST_ONLY=y
